<title>USA: IPO Ameripath shares, price range cut.</title>
<headline>IPO Ameripath shares, price range cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The proposed number of shares and price range for the initial public offering in Ameripath Inc were cut, lead underwriter Morgan Stanley said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Ameripath Inc, which was initially expected to offer 6.2 million shares at a proposed price range of $13 to $15, reduced the number of shares on offer to four million at a target price of $10.</p>
<p>Ameripath, a physician practice management company, is expected to trade on Friday.</p>
